OL,3,GNEWSACarshalton ponds drain for second
OL,4,Atime this year
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirds have had to be rescued from ponds
OL,7,Fin south London after the water drained
OL,8,Faway for the second time this year.
OL,10,FThe ponds in Carshalton, a well-known
OL,11,Flocal beauty spot and a source of the
OL,12,FRiver Wandle, were completely dry last
OL,13,Fweek, and after recent rain only mud
OL,14,Fand a few centimetres of water remain.
OL,16,FSutton Council, which emptied the upper
OL,17,Fpond in July to repair a leak, said the
OL,18,Fdrought was only part of the problem
OL,19,Fand it had brought in specialists to
OL,20,Ffind out what had gone wrong.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
