OL,3,GNEWSACarshalton ponds drain for second
OL,4,Atime this year
OL,5,
OL,6,FVuki Popovic, a volunteer at The Swan
OL,7,FSanctuary, said the conditions were
OL,8,Fdangerous for wildlife.
